@gw = http://localhost:8080
# Jeton : scripts/token.sh <e-mail> (15 min)
@token = COLLER_LE_JETON_ICI

### Poser une question (≤ 1000 caractères)
POST {{gw}}/api/chatbot/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Où se trouve la pelle hydraulique PEL-CAT320-01 ?" }

### Continuer une conversation
POST {{gw}}/api/chatbot/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Et quand est sa prochaine maintenance ?", "conversationId": "REMPLACER_ID" }

### Mes conversations
GET {{gw}}/api/chatbot/historique?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Une conversation
GET {{gw}}/api/chatbot/historique/REMPLACER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Supprimer (204)
DELETE {{gw}}/api/chatbot/historique/REMPLACER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Questions types selon le rôle
GET {{gw}}/api/chatbot/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
